{"id":1131001,"name":"舒鲁玛·审查Ⅰ","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"舒鲁玛·审查Ⅰ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1131001]}],"trial":{"trial_id":131001,"stage":"阶段1","unlock_time":"2024-09-10 14:00:00","diary1":"极乐岛事件结束得不算圆满，但你依然没有忘记上门收容那个“还有暑假作业没做完”的小禁闭者——以夏令营老师的名义。好消息是，她知情识趣，相当配合。\n　　但同样有个坏消息：她的家人以家族需要她出席晚宴为由，反复骚扰你，向你施压。而进入管理局的舒鲁玛，却拒绝被保释回家。","diary2":"双重压力下，你和舒鲁玛面谈，并借此意识到了舒鲁玛那压抑的家庭环境给她造成的压力，这也解释了她为何选择在线上发泄情绪。\n　　为了查明原因，解决问题，你选择扮作她的老师陪同她前往晚宴现场，以此评估是否应该让她留在管理局。","evidence":[{"ID":260615,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260616,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":3,"dialogue_id":231001003,"next":[4]},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231001023,"next":null},{"step":24,"c